      "portraitId": "ph-about",
      "bio": [
        "Felipe Pidi is an AI Creative & Design Leader based in São Paulo, Brazil. For more than twelve years he has worked across creative direction, art direction, branding, visual identity systems and integrated campaigns — work that has to hold together from a single frame to a national rollout.",
        "He has spent the last three-plus years leading creative teams and multidisciplinary design processes. Today, as AI Creative Lead at Jotacom, he builds hybrid pipelines where traditional art direction sets the taste and generative tools carry it at scale: campaigns, visual systems and production workflows other designers can pick up and run.",
        "Along the way he has made work for Mercado Livre, UOL, Duolingo, KFC and Óticas Diniz, among others. His method is easy to describe and hard to fake — a clear point of view, strategy that earns its place, new technology used with intent, and his own hands on the production."
      ],
